{
  "title": "Kit Builder",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Build 16-pad drum",
        "kits from the Move",
        "User or Core",
        "Library: random-",
        "draw by role,",
        "audition on the",
        "pads, lock keepers,",
        "re-roll the rest,",
        "match levels, then",
        "save.",
        "",
        "Save also exports a",
        "native Move drum",
        "preset (.ablpreset)",
        "to Track Presets;",
        "it also loads in",
        "MrDrums.",
        "",
        "Open from Schwung's",
        "overtake menu.",
        "Back parks it,",
        "Shift+Back exits."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Turn the jog wheel",
        "to move between",
        "RANDOM, KIT,",
        "SYSTEM and EXPORT.",
        "",
        "Press the jog wheel",
        "to fire the current",
        "page's button.",
        "",
        "Back parks Kit",
        "Builder with state",
        "intact; Shift+Back",
        "fully exits."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "The left 4x4 block",
        "is pads 1-16, laid",
        "out like a Move",
        "drum rack (kick",
        "bottom-left).",
        "",
        "Green  = loaded.",
        "White  = loaded +",
        "         locked.",
        "Bright = sounding.",
        "Amber  = sample",
        "         won't load.",
        "Teal   = empty.",
        "Dim wt = empty +",
        "         locked.",
        "Red    = no sample",
        "         was found.",
        "",
        "Press an assigned",
        "pad to hear it.",
        "Shift + Pad locks",
        "or unlocks it;",
        "locked pads survive",
        "Assign and Clear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "RANDOM page",
      "lines": [
        "Up / Down pick an",
        "action, jog press",
        "fires it:",
        "",
        "Assign - fill every",
        "  unlocked pad. Hold",
        "  a pad + Assign to",
        "  re-roll just that one.",
        "New - blank kit (two",
        "  presses to confirm).",
        "Save - name + write",
        "  to KitBuilder/Kits;",
        "  re-saving overwrites",
        "  the same file. Also",
        "  runs the enabled",
        "  exporters (Move",
        "  preset .ablpreset",
        "  into Track Presets).",
        "Clear - empty unlocked",
        "  pads.",
        "Unlock All - drop",
        "  every lock.",
        "Match Levels - even",
        "  out pad loudness.",
        "",
        "Step buttons 1-6 are",
        "the same actions, colour",
        "coded. Tap to pick,",
        "tap again to run.",
        "",
        "Knob 1 = Duplicates",
        "  (Avoid / Allow).",
        "Knob 2 = Source",
        "  (User / Core / Both).",
        "",
        "The kit reloads on",
        "restart; New starts",
        "fresh."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "KIT page",
      "lines": [
        "Knob 1 selects a",
        "pad; the page shows",
        "its role, sample",
        "and lock state.",
        "",
        "Knob 5 trims the",
        "pad's gain (dB).",
        "",
        "Up favourites /",
        "Down rejects this",
        "sample for future",
        "draws. Shift+Up /",
        "Shift+Down clear",
        "the whole list.",
        "",
        "Jog press clears",
        "the selected pad",
        "(unless it is",
        "locked)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "SYSTEM page",
      "lines": [
        "Jog press Rescans:",
        "walks the library,",
        "sorts samples by",
        "folder name into",
        "Kick, Snare, Hats,",
        "etc., and shows",
        "counts.",
        "",
        "Folder matching is",
        "case- and separator-",
        "insensitive; the",
        "deepest matching",
        "folder wins. A",
        "filename keyword",
        "match is the",
        "fallback.",
        "",
        "Knob 1 = skip loops.",
        "Knob 2 = max sample",
        "  size cap."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "EXPORT page",
      "lines": [
        "Up / Down select a",
        "row, jog press acts",
        "on it.",
        "",
        "Toggle each format",
        "on / off:",
        "  Move preset",
        "  .ablpreset (on) -",
        "  the native Move",
        "  drum-rack preset,",
        "  also loads in",
        "  MrDrums.",
        "  MPC .xpm (off) -",
        "  Akai MPC program",
        "  with gathered",
        "  samples.",
        "",
        "Export now runs the",
        "enabled formats for",
        "the current kit.",
        "Save runs them too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencer",
      "lines": [
        "An audition step",
        "sequencer for",
        "hearing the kit in",
        "a pattern.",
        "",
        "Rec toggles the",
        "edit view; the 16",
        "step buttons arm /",
        "disarm steps for",
        "the pad on Knob 1.",
        "",
        "Play runs / stops,",
        "independent of the",
        "view. Tempo follows",
        "the Move's BPM.",
        "",
        "The pattern is",
        "transient - not",
        "saved, not",
        "exported. New",
        "clears it."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
